{"code":0,"message":"success","resultList":[{"topicId":"0202206298304106575","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0302206298304106466","parentPostId":"0","authorId":"393eaf0f10544b699d3a54316f6f2bc7","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":1,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><p>开发者使用JavaScript/TypeScript在其他平台上开发Electron工程。当前计划适配HarmonyOS PC，如何进行迁移适配？</p></div>","createTime":"20260425022005","updateTime":"20260813173757","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[],"lastEditUid":"393eaf0f10544b699d3a54316f6f2bc7","lastEditTime":"20260425022005","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":0,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":1,"quality":0},{"topicId":"0202206298304106575","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0304217960196141068","parentPostId":"0303217957959313663","authorId":"be823d5a3f6d4d31aab63916e45e23e9","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"{\"content\":\"能否详细讲一讲基于Harmony electron预编译产物调试的签名步骤那里哇\",\"time\":\"2026-06-27 07:52:39\",\"uid\":\"be823d5a3f6d4d31aab63916e45e23e9\",\"pid\":\"0303217957959313663\"}","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\">顺便提一嘴，我创建一个Hello world的ability项目可以自动签名调试通过 在开鸿os里运行，都是openHarmony平台只是项目类型不一样，证书也会不一样吗</div>","createTime":"20260627082956","updateTime":"20260813180838","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[],"lastEditTime":"20260627082956","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":0,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":0,"displayOfficial":0,"ipHomeArea":"湖南","quality":0},{"topicId":"0202206298304106575","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0303217957959313663","parentPostId":"0302206298304106466","authorId":"be823d5a3f6d4d31aab63916e45e23e9","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><p>能否详细讲一讲基于Harmony electron预编译产物调试的签名步骤那里哇，我卡在这个步骤好几天了，完全没有思路，老板给我一台X86的淘汰笔记本，让我装了一个基于openHarmony的深开鸿OS-X86桌面版系统，让我做纯血鸿蒙适配。。。</p>  <p>我的困惑是，1.老板是不是这个概念首先就不对，纯血鸿蒙一般都是基于arm指令集的设备，就算我跑通了x86的调试，依然不可能直接打包上架为纯血鸿蒙的hap应用</p>  <p>2.这个在项目结构里勾选自动签名后，在调试的最后一步里报错说是</p>  <blockquote> <p>The target device does not work with apps with an OpenHarmony signature. Sign the app with a HarmonyOS signature before installing it on the device.</p> </blockquote>  <p>可是目标设备就是openHarmony啊，还是说我的配置文件哪里不对劲，</p>  <p><span class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img data-originheight=\"649\" data-originwidth=\"802\" src=\"cid:pic_0\"/></span></p>  <p>请大佬给于指导，非常感谢！！！</p></div>","createTime":"20260627075239","updateTime":"20260813175529","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[{"fileName":"pic_0","fileSize":249774,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtybbs/021/285/402/4F1DE2A3FEAE093A8A215962EA68B5D0:96D6FD8E71E6E757D03EAB27E4840215B7D9706F05BED366427A358E71C995A8.20260627155210.61301464520745538288192588034264:50001231000000:2800:A734D336AC8A87E56337A066DE8B53E45CBBEED7AAB2BC8DC8969C48DCC90157.png","filePathType":0,"fileType":0,"needLogin":0,"retryNum":0}],"hrefInfoList":[],"lastEditTime":"20260627075239","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":3,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":0,"displayOfficial":0,"ipHomeArea":"湖南","quality":0},{"topicId":"0202206298304106575","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0301217593398775215","parentPostId":"0302206298304106466","authorId":"3ee6a184356f455fa0db5375483fa504","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\">你好，有详细的适配教程吗，这个里面很多点已经讲到了，可以很多细节没有讲，还是捉摸不透啊</div>","createTime":"20260623023638","updateTime":"20260813172803","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[],"lastEditTime":"20260623023638","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":2,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":0,"displayOfficial":0,"ipHomeArea":"广东","quality":0},{"topicId":"0202206298304106575","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0302206298304118467","parentPostId":"0302206298304106466","authorId":"393eaf0f10544b699d3a54316f6f2bc7","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><p><strong>【背景知识】</strong></p>  <ul>  <li>  <p>Electron是基于Chromium+Node.js的桌面应用框架。采用主进程+渲染进程多进程模型，主进程运行Node.js负责应用生命周期，渲染进程运行Chromium内核呈现HTML5界面。通过集成V8引擎，使Web前端技术栈与底层系统功能结合，开发者可用JavaScript构建跨平台桌面应用。</p>  </li>  <li>  <p>其他平台Electron开发流程：</p>  </li> </ul>  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_0\"/></p>  <p><strong>【解决方案】</strong></p> 1. Electron版本选择：  <p>当前已提供两个HarmonyOS化版本：Electron25和Electron34，可以使用华为账号登录<a href=\"cid:link_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">仓库</a>下载最新版本的Release包，这两个版本对应的Chromium内核和node.js版本情况如下：</p>  <table style=\"table-layout: fixed;width: 784.0px;\">     <tr>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 160.0px;\"></td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 210.0px;\">Electron25</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 208.0px;\">Electron34</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 191.0px;\">Electron37</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 160.0px;\">Chromium</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 210.0px;\">Chromium114</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 208.0px;\">    <p>Chromium132</p>    </td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 191.0px;\">Chromium138</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 160.0px;\">Node.js</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 210.0px;\">18.18.2</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 208.0px;\">20.18.1</td>    <td style=\"height: 32.0px;width: 191.0px;\">22.16.0</td>   </tr>   </table>  <p>在选择Electron版本时，需要考虑以下几点：</p>  <ul>  <li>Electron版本及Node.js版本是否满足应用使用三方库需求。</li>  <li>对于前端库，需检查其依赖的浏览器API是否被选择的Electron版本对应Chromium版本支持。</li> </ul>  <p>如果是由其他平台迁移至HarmonyOS，以尽快完成HarmonyOS化为目的的话，可以考虑使用与其他平台版本更接近的Electron版本，否则出于版本迭代考虑，更推荐使用更新版本Electron。</p> 2. 整体迁移思路如下：  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_1\"/></p>  <ol>  <li>分析依赖，对不满足的依赖进行适配和替换。</li>  <li>业务代码适配HarmonyOS，对差异点如权限判断，平台判断，沙箱路径等进行修改。</li>  <li>TypeScript开发可选：编译TypeScript为JavaScript。</li>  <li>将编译产物及<code>package.json</code>复制到<a href=\"cid:link_1\" rel=\"nofollow\">HarmonyOS化Electron样例工程</a>中，并删除<code>package.json</code>的<code>devDependencies</code>字段。</li>  <li>在HarmonyOS的Electron工程中安装依赖，并启动工程，查看依赖是否正常。若不正常，则回退到第1步进行依赖适配。</li> </ol>  <blockquote> <p>最佳实践：</p> </blockquote>  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_2\"/></p>  <blockquote> <p>1.原始Electron工程和HarmonyOS Electron工程互不包含，分别使用VSCode/WebStorm和DevEco Studio打开两个工程。 2.Electron工程编译并使用electron-builder打包，其中<code>package.json</code>中<code>build</code>字段设置<code>asar: false</code>，拷贝asar拆包后的app文件产物到HarmonyOS Electron工程目录。</p> </blockquote>  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_3\"/></p>  <blockquote> <p>3.替换node_modules中C/C++ Native模块为使用HarmonyOS编译工具链编译的产物，并将相关<code>.node/.so</code>放置在<code>ohos_hap\\electron\\libs\\arm64-v8a</code>目录下，并修改引入路径。</p> </blockquote> 3. 编译常见问题：调用与接口声明不一致。 问题描述：  <ul>  <li>  <p>问题1：TS开发的Electron项目，调用<a href=\"cid:link_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">SystemPreferences请求权限接口</a>报错。</p>   <blockquote>  <p>报错：error TS2339: Property 'requestSystemPermission' does not exist on type 'SystemPreferences'.`。</p>  </blockquote>  </li>  <li>  <p>问题2：TS开发的Electron项目，使用<code>const currentPlatform: NodeJS.Platform = 'win32'</code>判断<code>currentPlatform === 'ohos'</code>平台时发生报错。</p>   <blockquote>  <p>报错error TS2367: This comparison appears to be unintentional because the types 'win32' and 'ohos' have no overlap.</p>  </blockquote>  </li> </ul> 问题1&amp;2根因分析：  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_4\"/></p>  <p>HarmonyOS的Electron相比开源版本，在Electron层新增了暴露的接口，如权限相关接口。Windows环境的接口声明（electron.d.ts）没有HarmonyOS的权限接口，因此TS编译阶段报错。</p> 修改方案：  <ul>  <li>问题1： 使用<a href=\"cid:link_4\" rel=\"nofollow\">HarmonyOS化的Electron源码</a>中<a href=\"cid:link_3\" rel=\"nofollow\">src/electron/electron.d.ts</a>替换掉业务代码里的<code>node_modules/electron/electron.d.ts</code>。</li> </ul>  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_5\"/></p>  <ul>  <li>问题2： Node.js原始接口声明中没有<code>ohos</code>，HarmonyOS版本的Node.js为了和开源版本保持一致，暂不在Platform中新增<code>ohos</code>。</li> </ul>  <p><img src=\"cid:pic_6\"/></p>  <p>因此建议开发者使用<code>process.platform</code>进行判断。</p> 其他同类错误也可使用问题1和2的解法一并解决：  <div style=\"max-width: 100.0%;\"> <table>  <thead>   <tr>    <th>序号</th>    <th>错误码</th>    <th>中文描述</th>   </tr>  </thead>     <tr>    <td>1</td>    <td>TS2345</td>    <td>参数赋值时类型不匹配所以赋值失败。</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>2</td>    <td>TS2554</td>    <td>实参和形参个数不匹配</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>3</td>    <td>TS2346</td>    <td>参数类型X不能赋值给参数类型Y，通常出现于函数重载场景</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>4</td>    <td>TS2339</td>    <td>调用了不存在的属性</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>5</td>    <td>TS2684</td>    <td>泛型约束不匹配</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>6</td>    <td>TS2769</td>    <td>没有对应的重载方法。</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>7</td>    <td>TS2564</td>    <td>属性没有初始化器，也未在构造函数中明确赋值。</td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td>8</td>    <td>TS2367</td>    <td>变量比较时类型不匹配</td>   </tr>   </table> </div>  <p><strong>【总结】</strong> Electron项目适配HarmonyOS PC，主要工作是使用HarmonyOS适配版Electron重新打包构建应用，并替换掉不兼容Node插件模块集成的功能。 如果使用TS开发Electron项目，迁移过程中TS转JS失败是常见易错点之一。若出现以上错误码，从接口声明方向排查。</p>  <p><strong>【常见FAQ】</strong> Q：HarmonyOS开发需要使用.node，在Electron工程中引入后，yarn build报错<code>error TS2307: Cannot find module xxx</code>。 A：yarn build:tsc本身并不自动检查.node文件，请检查是否手动配置了相关校验。</p>  <p>Q：Electron工程中引入.node，指明了<code>const addon = require('/data/storage/el1/bundle/libs/arm64/libaddon.node')</code>，使用webpack编译后移植到HarmonyOS工程中运行，HarmonyOS工程对应位置已引入了该node，但运行时仍报错<code>Cannot find module '/data/storage/el1/bundle/libs/arm64/libaddon.node'</code>。 A：配置webpack的externals，让webpack不对这个addon模块进行解析和打包，保留require语句的原样，在运行时再去加载。在<code>webpack.config.js</code>的<code>externals</code>字段中添加<code>'libaddon.node': 'commonjs /data/storage/el1/bundle/libs/arm64/libaddon.node'</code>后可以直接<code>const addon = require('libaddon.node')</code>。</p>  <p>Q：在Electron开发中，如何判断当前的平台是HarmonyOS？ A：可以通过node.js的<code>process.platform</code>进行判断，HarmonyOS平台输出的字段是openharmony。</p></div>","createTime":"20260425022005","updateTime":"20260813173757","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[{"fileName":"pic_0","fileSize":0,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtybbs/890/015/889/17A91AE171BC5B2596950188C8FF7983:6854197C08D8D9F5C8596F11864604AE275363B1E96D4E8812086858068330C8.20260212170502.32205498780540669182235610362004:50001231000000:2800:24373D4FC9E6C53445A5BF2881D99564940E73C9F01D4BD42C8C7CF98C17014E.png","filePathType":1,"fileType":0,"needLogin":0,"retryNum":0},{"fileName":"pic_1","fileSize":0,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtybbs/890/015/889/A9543C241C928FC34EF4D53DA0B1C318:C2359B8238FEAB1585DB805A7A35FC77DD20CA3DFCED63E39DFA74162A1AA6AB.20260325155332.45436788071553220471231799748193:50001231000000:2800:F88EEF38AE45821058F8F65576AF7E27FE86241186AF3B9822A698200A3AC027.png","filePathType":1,"fileType":0,"needLogin":0,"retryNum":0},{"fileName":"pic_2","fileSize":0,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtybbs/890/015/889/A9543C241C928FC34EF4D53DA0B1C318:C2359B8238FEAB1585DB805A7A35FC77DD20CA3DFCED63E39DFA74162A1AA6AB.20260325155411.66724001234117620545284491481259:50001231000000:2800:5CCF9DE77EC34E6FD207B9B95FEAEAECF9834E12A0DF205D77B439430E5FAA29.png","filePathType":1,"fileType":0,"needLogin":0,"retryNum":0},{"fileName":"pic_3","fileSize":0,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtybbs/890/015/889/A9543C241C928FC34EF4D53DA0B1C318:C2359B8238FEAB1585DB805A7A35FC77DD20CA3DFCED63E39DFA74162A1AA6AB.20260325155437.87677436142493681745976058371548:50001231000000:2800:217AD9A1CBA1BDF84143B236FB3B3BD393AAB8C4F2DB686B6EAAE17911C9E768.png","filePathType":1,"fileType":0,"needLogin":0,"retryNum":0},{"fileName":"pic_4","fileSize":0,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtybbs/890/015/889/A9543C241C928FC34EF4D53DA0B1C318:C2359B8238FEAB1585DB805A7A35FC77DD20CA3DFCED63E39DFA74162A1AA6AB.20260325155514.17123795415160116648900198761284:50001231000000:2800:BDE9D4F26F8960D5B05D